caddy-tui (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Interface translated: English (default) and Spanish, chosen at startup
    from --lang, CADDY_TUI_LANG, a saved preference ([L] key) or the system
    locale.
  * Packaged as a Debian package (architecture-independent).
  * Fix: snippets such as "(name) {" were counted as sites.

